{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ pool fee on DyorHQ's locked liquidity, collected hourly, in both %@ and %@. Each is split %@ DyorHQ, %@ holders or creator. No creator fee after graduation. DyorHQ keeps the %@ it collects; it earns no holder rewards and isn't sold automatically." : {
      "comment" : "A graduated Stellar coin: what happens to its pool's fees. Values in order: the pool fee (0.3%), the quote asset (XLM), the coin's ticker, DyorHQ's share (50%), the holders' or creator's share (50%), the coin's ticker. DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ pool fee on DyorHQ's locked liquidity, collected hourly, in both %2$@ and %3$@. Each is split %4$@ DyorHQ, %5$@ holders or creator. No creator fee after graduation. DyorHQ keeps the %6$@ it collects; it earns no holder rewards and isn't sold automatically."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comisión del pool de %1$@ sobre la liquidez bloqueada de DyorHQ, cobrada cada hora, en %2$@ y en %3$@. Cada una se reparte %4$@ para DyorHQ y %5$@ para los holders o el creador. Sin comisión de creador después de la graduación. DyorHQ conserva los %6$@ que cobra; no gana recompensas de holder y no se venden automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frais de pool de %1$@ sur la liquidité verrouillée de DyorHQ, collectés chaque heure, en %2$@ et en %3$@. Chacun est réparti %4$@ pour DyorHQ, %5$@ pour les détenteurs ou le créateur. Pas de frais de créateur après la graduation. DyorHQ garde les %6$@ qu'il collecte ; ils ne gagnent aucune récompense de détenteur et ne sont pas vendus automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ의 잠긴 유동성에 붙는 %1$@ 풀 수수료는 매시간 %2$@와 %3$@ 두 가지로 수집돼요. 각각 DyorHQ %4$@, 홀더 또는 크리에이터 %5$@로 나뉘어요. 졸업 후에는 크리에이터 수수료가 없어요. DyorHQ는 수집한 %6$@를 보유하며, 홀더 보상을 받지 않고 자동으로 팔지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ 锁定流动性的 %1$@ 资金池费用每小时收取一次，以 %2$@ 和 %3$@ 两种形式。每部分按 DyorHQ %4$@、持有者或创作者 %5$@ 分配。毕业后不再收取创作者费用。DyorHQ 保留其收取的 %6$@；这些代币不赚取持有者奖励，也不会被自动卖出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Change" : {
      "comment" : "Button and review title on a Stellar coin's page: carry out a proposed change of its fee recipient, now that its waiting time is over",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar cambio"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appliquer le changement"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "변경 적용"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "执行变更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Fee Recipient" : {
      "comment" : "Button, screen and review title on a Stellar coin's page, for the account that receives its creator fees: hand them to another account",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cambiar receptor de comisiones"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changer le destinataire des frais"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수수료 수령인 변경"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改费用接收方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claim Owed Fees" : {
      "comment" : "Button and review title on a Stellar coin's page: collect the creator fees earned before its fee recipient changed",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cobrar comisiones adeudadas"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Récupérer les frais dus"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "미지급 수수료 받기"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "领取欠付费用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counted from this coin's transfers we've read, so there may be more holders." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar coin's holder count shown as a minimum (“5+”): some of its transfers couldn't be read yet",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contados a partir de las transferencias de esta moneda que hemos leído, así que puede haber más holders."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comptés à partir des transferts de ce coin que nous avons lus : il peut y avoir plus de détenteurs."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "읽어 온 이 코인의 전송 기록으로 센 숫자라 홀더가 더 있을 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据我们已读取的该代币转账统计，持有者可能更多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creator tax is charged on curve trades only. You, or the fee recipient you set, receive it with a share of the curve fee and, after graduation, %@ of the fees its locked %@ liquidity earns (%@ go to DyorHQ). With fee sharing on, holders receive all of it instead." : {
      "comment" : "The footer of Advanced on Stellar's Launch a Coin screen. The values are shares (50%, 50%) and the graduation venue's name (Soroswap, never translated). DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El impuesto del creador solo se cobra en las operaciones de la curva. Lo recibes tú (o el receptor de comisiones que indiques) junto con una parte de la comisión de la curva y, tras la graduación, el %1$@ de las comisiones que genera su liquidez bloqueada en %2$@ (el %3$@ va a DyorHQ). Con el reparto de comisiones activado, los holders lo reciben todo en tu lugar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La taxe du créateur ne s'applique qu'aux échanges de la courbe. Vous la recevez (ou le destinataire des frais que vous choisissez) avec une part des frais de la courbe et, après la graduation, %1$@ des frais que rapporte sa liquidité verrouillée sur %2$@ (%3$@ vont à DyorHQ). Avec le partage des frais activé, ce sont les détenteurs qui reçoivent le tout."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "크리에이터 세금은 커브 거래에만 붙어요. 나(또는 지정한 수수료 수령인)는 이 세금과 커브 수수료 일부를 받고, 졸업 후에는 %2$@에 잠긴 유동성이 버는 수수료의 %1$@를 받아요(%3$@는 DyorHQ 몫). 수수료 분배를 켜면 대신 홀더가 전부 받아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创作者税仅对曲线交易收取。你（或你设置的费用接收方）会连同部分曲线手续费一起收到它，毕业后还会获得其锁定在 %2$@ 的流动性所赚手续费的 %1$@（%3$@ 归 DyorHQ）。开启手续费分成时，则全部由持有者获得。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Curve fee share" : {
      "comment" : "On a Stellar coin's page, creator fees: the part of every curve trade's fee that goes to the creator (or to holders when fee sharing is on), as a percent of the trade",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parte de la comisión de la curva"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Part des frais de la courbe"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "커브 수수료 몫"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "曲线费用分成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Curve fees earned so far stay with the current recipient. Pool fees not yet collected go to the new one." : {
      "comment" : "On a Stellar coin's page and in the review of a fee recipient change: what a change of the account that receives creator fees does to fees already earned",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las comisiones de la curva ganadas hasta ahora se quedan con el receptor actual. Las comisiones del pool aún no cobradas van al nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les frais de courbe gagnés jusqu'ici restent au destinataire actuel. Les frais de pool pas encore collectés vont au nouveau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금까지 쌓인 커브 수수료는 현재 수령인에게 남아요. 아직 수집되지 않은 풀 수수료는 새 수령인에게 가요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前已赚取的曲线费用归当前接收方。尚未收取的资金池费用归新接收方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DEX pools of this coin are excluded from holder rewards once DyorHQ verifies them. Other contracts that hold the coin, such as lending markets and vaults, keep earning rewards that only they can claim." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar coin's holder rewards: which holders don't earn them. DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los pools de DEX de esta moneda quedan excluidos de las recompensas de holder cuando DyorHQ los verifica. Otros contratos que tienen la moneda, como mercados de préstamo y bóvedas, siguen ganando recompensas que solo ellos pueden cobrar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les pools DEX de ce coin sont exclus des récompenses de détenteur dès que DyorHQ les vérifie. Les autres contrats qui détiennent le coin, comme les marchés de prêt et les coffres, continuent de gagner des récompenses qu'eux seuls peuvent récupérer."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 코인의 DEX 풀은 DyorHQ가 확인하면 홀더 보상에서 제외돼요. 대출 마켓이나 볼트처럼 이 코인을 보유한 다른 컨트랙트는 계속 보상을 받지만, 그 보상은 해당 컨트랙트만 받을 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ 核实后，该代币的 DEX 资金池将不再获得持有者奖励。持有该代币的其他合约（如借贷市场和金库）仍会赚取奖励，但只有它们自己能领取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dollar values use mainnet market prices. Testnet assets have no value." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar coin's price on its page: its dollar figures come from real mainnet prices of its quote asset, while testnet coins themselves are worth nothing",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los valores en dólares usan precios de mercado de mainnet. Los activos de testnet no tienen valor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les valeurs en dollars utilisent les prix du marché du mainnet. Les actifs du testnet n'ont aucune valeur."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "달러 가치는 메인넷 시장 가격을 사용해요. 테스트넷 자산은 가치가 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "美元价值采用主网市场价格。测试网资产没有价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
