    "Graduates to a %@ pool, liquidity locked forever, once the curve raises %@ %@." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the pairing on Stellar's Launch a Coin screen. Values: the venue's name (Soroswap), the raise that completes the curve, and its asset (XLM)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Graduates to a %1$@ pool, liquidity locked forever, once the curve raises %2$@ %3$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se gradúa a un pool de %1$@, con la liquidez bloqueada para siempre, cuando la curva recauda %2$@ %3$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gradue vers un pool %1$@, liquidité verrouillée pour toujours, une fois que la courbe a levé %2$@ %3$@."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "커브가 %2$@ %3$@를 모으면 %1$@ 풀로 졸업하고 유동성은 영구히 잠겨요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "曲线筹集到 %2$@ %3$@ 后，毕业进入 %1$@ 资金池，流动性永久锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Graduating" : {
      "comment" : "[tight] A Stellar launch's phase: its curve is full and it graduates into its pool within minutes",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Graduándose"
          }
        },
