            "value" : "Graduación retrasada"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Graduation retardée"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업 지연"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毕业延迟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Graduation didn't happen in time, so the curve's funds are shared out: each coin you give back is burned and pays the same amount to every holder, whatever the order." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of a rescued Stellar launch's refund ticket: why refunds are open and that every holder gets the same rate",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La graduación no llegó a tiempo, así que los fondos de la curva se reparten: cada moneda que devuelves se quema y paga la misma cantidad a cada holder, sin importar el orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La graduation n'a pas eu lieu à temps, les fonds de la courbe sont donc répartis : chaque coin que vous rendez est brûlé et rapporte le même montant à chaque détenteur, quel que soit l'ordre."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업이 제때 이뤄지지 않아 커브의 자금을 나눠 드려요. 돌려주는 코인은 소각되고, 순서와 상관없이 모든 홀더가 같은 금액을 받아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毕业未能按时完成，因此曲线资金将被分配：你退回的每枚代币都会被销毁，并按相同金额支付给每位持有者，与先后顺序无关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Graduation grace" : {
      "comment" : "In the review of a Stellar launch: how long a full curve may take to graduate before anyone can mark it delayed",
      "localizations" : {
