    },
    "Holders also earn part of the pool fees after graduation, in this coin and in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar coin's holder rewards, and the Share fees with holders setting: after graduation holders also get part of the pool's fees, in the coin and in its quote asset. The value is the quote asset (XLM)",
      "localizations" : {
