    "Not enough XLM: you can spend %@. The rest keeps your account open and pays the network fee." : {
      "comment" : "Under a Stellar curve buy with XLM, when the amount is more than the account can spend. The value is an amount of XLM. XLM is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No tienes suficiente XLM: puedes gastar %@. El resto mantiene tu cuenta abierta y paga la comisión de red."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pas assez de XLM : vous pouvez dépenser %@. Le reste garde votre compte ouvert et paie les frais de réseau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "XLM이 부족해요: %@까지 쓸 수 있어요. 나머지는 계정을 유지하고 네트워크 수수료를 내는 데 쓰여요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "XLM 不足：你最多可花费 %@。其余部分用于保持账户开放并支付网络费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough XLM: you need %@ XLM more. The %@ XLM launch fee, the network fee and your account's minimum balance come first." : {
      "comment" : "On Stellar's Launch a Coin screen, before the review: the account's XLM doesn't cover the launch. The first value is the XLM missing, the second the launch fee in XLM (10). XLM is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Not enough XLM: you need %1$@ XLM more. The %2$@ XLM launch fee, the network fee and your account's minimum balance come first."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No tienes suficiente XLM: necesitas %1$@ XLM más. Primero van la comisión de lanzamiento de %2$@ XLM, la comisión de red y el saldo mínimo de tu cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pas assez de XLM : il vous faut %1$@ XLM de plus. Les frais de lancement de %2$@ XLM, les frais de réseau et le solde minimum de votre compte passent d'abord."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "XLM이 부족해요: %1$@ XLM이 더 필요해요. %2$@ XLM 런칭 수수료, 네트워크 수수료, 계정 최소 잔액이 먼저예요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "XLM 不足：你还需要 %1$@ XLM。需先支付 %2$@ XLM 发射费、网络费用并保留账户最低余额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
