    "Refund at a fixed %@ per token, no fees, any time." : {
      "comment" : "A rescued Stellar launch's refund ticket: every holder gives back coins for the same fixed amount of the quote asset per coin, with no fees and no deadline. The value is that amount with its asset (0.000000048 XLM)",
