            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是 Stellar 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The creator earns the creator tax plus a share of the %@ curve fee on every curve trade. Fees wait in the launchpad until the creator claims them." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of a Stellar coin's creator fees. The value is the curve fee as a percent (1%)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El creador gana el impuesto de creador más una parte de la comisión de curva del %@ en cada operación de la curva. Las comisiones esperan en el launchpad hasta que el creador las cobra."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le créateur gagne la taxe de créateur plus une part des frais de courbe de %@ sur chaque échange de la courbe. Les frais attendent dans le launchpad jusqu'à ce que le créateur les récupère."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "크리에이터는 커브 거래마다 크리에이터 세금과 %@ 커브 수수료의 일부를 받아요. 수수료는 크리에이터가 받을 때까지 런치패드에 보관돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每笔曲线交易，创作者都能获得创作者税以及 %@ 曲线费用中的一部分。费用存放在发射台中，直到创作者领取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The curve is full. It graduates next, into a %@ pool with its liquidity locked forever, and then trades on Swap. DyorHQ graduates it within a few minutes, or you can do it now and pay only the network fee." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of a Stellar coin whose curve is full and waits to graduate. The value is the venue's name (Soroswap). DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La curva está llena. Ahora se gradúa a un pool de %@ con la liquidez bloqueada para siempre, y luego se opera en Swap. DyorHQ la gradúa en unos minutos, o puedes hacerlo ahora y pagar solo la comisión de red."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La courbe est pleine. Il gradue ensuite vers un pool %@, liquidité verrouillée pour toujours, puis s'échange sur Swap. DyorHQ le gradue en quelques minutes, ou vous pouvez le faire maintenant et ne payer que les frais de réseau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "커브가 가득 찼어요. 다음으로 유동성이 영구히 잠긴 %@ 풀로 졸업한 뒤 스왑에서 거래돼요. DyorHQ가 몇 분 안에 졸업시키거나, 지금 직접 하고 네트워크 수수료만 낼 수도 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "曲线已满。接下来它将毕业进入 %@ 资金池，流动性永久锁定，之后在兑换中交易。DyorHQ 会在几分钟内完成毕业，你也可以现在自行操作，只需支付网络费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The curve's liquidity is locked forever in a %@ pool. Trades now route through Swap." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of a graduated Stellar coin's section. The value is the venue's name (Soroswap)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La liquidez de la curva está bloqueada para siempre en un pool de %@. Ahora las operaciones pasan por Swap."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La liquidité de la courbe est verrouillée pour toujours dans un pool %@. Les échanges passent désormais par Swap."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "커브의 유동성은 %@ 풀에 영구히 잠겨 있어요. 이제 거래는 스왑을 통해 이뤄져요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "曲线的流动性已永久锁定在 %@ 资金池中。现在交易通过兑换进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last graduation attempt failed. Anyone can retry it and pay only the network fee. If it keeps failing, the fallback venue opens, and then refunds at one fixed rate for every holder." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of a Stellar coin whose graduation is delayed: what happens next, in order",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El último intento de graduación falló. Cualquiera puede reintentarlo pagando solo la comisión de red. Si sigue fallando, se abre la plataforma alternativa y, después, los reembolsos a un precio fijo para todos los holders."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La dernière tentative de graduation a échoué. Tout le monde peut la relancer en ne payant que les frais de réseau. Si elle échoue encore, la plateforme de repli s'ouvre, puis les remboursements à un taux fixe pour chaque détenteur."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "마지막 졸업 시도가 실패했어요. 누구나 네트워크 수수료만 내고 다시 시도할 수 있어요. 계속 실패하면 대체 거래소가 열리고, 그다음 모든 홀더에게 같은 고정 금액으로 환불돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上一次毕业尝试失败。任何人都可以重试，只需支付网络费用。如果持续失败，将开放备用场所，之后再按统一的固定价格为所有持有者退款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pool's fee stays with the pool; no creator tax is charged after graduation." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of a graduated Stellar coin of the retired launchpad (v1): its pool's fees aren't shared out",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La comisión del pool se queda en el pool; no se cobra impuesto de creador después de la graduación."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les frais du pool restent dans le pool ; aucune taxe de créateur n'est prélevée après la graduation."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "풀 수수료는 풀에 남고, 졸업 후에는 크리에이터 세금이 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "资金池费用留在池中；毕业后不收取创作者税。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coin couldn't be read just now." : {
      "comment" : "On a Stellar coin's page, with Retry: its name, price and other figures couldn't be read",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
