            "value" : "暂时无法读取此币。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coin is on DyorHQ's retired launchpad: you can sell it on its curve and claim its fees. New buys are closed." : {
      "comment" : "On a Stellar coin of the retired launchpad (v1), above its ticket: only selling and claiming remain. DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta moneda está en el launchpad retirado de DyorHQ: puedes venderla en su curva y cobrar sus comisiones. Las compras nuevas están cerradas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce coin est sur l'ancien launchpad de DyorHQ : vous pouvez le vendre sur sa courbe et récupérer ses frais. Les nouveaux achats sont fermés."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 코인은 DyorHQ의 종료된 런치패드에 있어요. 커브에서 팔거나 수수료를 받을 수 있지만, 새로 살 수는 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该代币位于 DyorHQ 已停用的发射台：你可以在其曲线上卖出并领取费用，但不再开放买入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version of DyorHQ can't launch on Stellar's new launchpad yet. Update DyorHQ." : {
      "comment" : "On Stellar's Launch a Coin screen: this build of the app can't sign for the new launchpad. DyorHQ and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta versión de DyorHQ aún no puede lanzar en el nuevo launchpad de Stellar. Actualiza DyorHQ."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette version de DyorHQ ne peut pas encore lancer sur le nouveau launchpad de Stellar. Mettez DyorHQ à jour."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 버전의 DyorHQ는 아직 Stellar의 새 런치패드에서 런칭할 수 없어요. DyorHQ를 업데이트하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
