    "With fee sharing on, the creator fee and the creator's share of the curve fee go to holders as rewards, so there are no creator fees to claim. Turn sharing off to keep them." : {
      "comment" : "On Stellar's Launch a Coin screen and its review, while Share fees with holders is on: the creator's fees all go to the coin's holders",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con el reparto de comisiones activado, la comisión de creador y la parte del creador de la comisión de la curva van a los holders como recompensas, así que no habrá comisiones de creador que reclamar. Desactiva el reparto para quedártelas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec le partage des frais activé, les frais de créateur et la part du créateur des frais de courbe vont aux détenteurs sous forme de récompenses : il n'y aura donc aucuns frais de créateur à réclamer. Désactivez le partage pour les garder."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수수료 공유가 켜져 있으면 크리에이터 수수료와 크리에이터 몫의 커브 수수료가 홀더에게 보상으로 가서 받을 크리에이터 수수료가 없어요. 직접 받으려면 공유를 끄세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启费用分享后，创作者费用和创作者所得的曲线费用将作为奖励发给持有者，因此没有可领取的创作者费用。关闭分享即可自己保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With fee sharing on, the creator tax and the creator's share of the curve fee go to holders as rewards." : {
